{"source_id": "M06-Q03-S1", "author_text": "魏然是我表姐，比我大三岁。", "visual": null, "inference_uses_author_text_for_media": false}
{"source_id": "M06-Q03-S2", "author_text": "魏然的同事季朗下周来猫咪救助站帮忙，我和季朗还不认识。", "visual": null, "inference_uses_author_text_for_media": false}
{"source_id": "M06-Q04-S1", "author_text": "我不吃洋葱，聚餐点菜帮我避开。", "visual": null, "inference_uses_author_text_for_media": false}
{"source_id": "M06-Q04-S2", "author_text": "补充一下，不吃洋葱不包括用它熬的汤底，汤底我可以喝，只是别放碎叶子。", "visual": null, "inference_uses_author_text_for_media": false}
{"source_id": "M06-Q05-S1", "author_text": "领养登记原定2026-05-16前交给猫咪救助站。", "visual": null, "inference_uses_author_text_for_media": false}
{"source_id": "M06-Q05-S2", "author_text": "魏然发来通知：领养登记统一顺延一周，新的截止日期是2026-05-23，原日期作废。", "visual": null, "inference_uses_author_text_for_media": false}
{"source_id": "M06-Q06-S1", "author_text": "航空箱放在东侧仓库的储物柜里。", "visual": null, "inference_uses_author_text_for_media": false}
